WEBVTT

01:36.500 --> 01:39.000
Found you.

01:39.000 --> 01:42.330
NO!

02:18.580 --> 02:23.130
Y..Y..Yayoi-chan!

02:23.250 --> 02:24.710
I was so scared!

02:24.710 --> 02:27.960
Don't let your guard down. He can regenerate.

02:29.830 --> 02:31.330
Oh, right!

02:31.500 --> 02:35.460
You see that candle he was holding?
You can't let him blow it out!

02:35.670 --> 02:36.500
Why's that?

02:37.000 --> 02:38.750
I saw what happened to Gonda...

02:41.670 --> 02:50.290
Got it. Sounds like if he catches you,
your solo game of hide-and-seek is over.

02:51.790 --> 02:58.290
I'm guessing leaving the school to enter
someone else's game wasn't part of his plan.

02:59.500 --> 03:04.130
If this is a game, then there has to be a way for us to win.

03:04.420 --> 03:06.040
How, though?

03:06.790 --> 03:14.710
He created this place from his memories,
so the key might lie in the room he died in.

03:15.580 --> 03:16.710
Let's head back to that locked room.

03:17.830 --> 03:19.540
O-okay!

03:23.500 --> 03:27.040
Yayoi-chan, you can save us, right?

03:27.420 --> 03:28.130
Absolutely.

03:28.880 --> 03:31.420
Do you think Gonda is dead?

03:31.630 --> 03:38.710
Can't tell from what you told me, but we might be able
to save him if the ghost passes on peacefully.

03:39.960 --> 03:40.670
Okay.

03:53.460 --> 03:56.710
Found you.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.330
Don't stop! Keep running!

04:30.130 --> 04:30.920
We're here.

04:40.710 --> 04:42.710
Wh-what are those?

04:46.830 --> 04:50.750
Oh, God! Why is my picture there?!

04:57.460 --> 05:02.460
Rep disappeared, but in a different way than Daisuke did.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.170
I've got it.

05:04.920 --> 05:09.330
Grabbing your picture is how you win the game.

05:11.920 --> 05:12.670
Found mine.

05:19.580 --> 05:21.540
Found y-

05:26.420 --> 05:28.790
Sheesh. Can't let my guard down for a second.

05:33.380 --> 05:34.040
Oh, no!

05:45.630 --> 05:48.420
Ya..Yayoi-chan!

05:49.130 --> 05:50.040
Rep...

05:55.000 --> 05:56.880
We were trapped inside a dream.

05:57.880 --> 06:01.460
And if you get caught in the dream, you end up like that.

06:03.500 --> 06:07.500
There must be something here in real life, too.

06:08.000 --> 06:10.710
Let's figure it out and save Daisuke and the others.

06:20.500 --> 06:22.880
Is this what his ghost has become?

06:24.630 --> 06:27.500
Looks like a brain that's withered away.

06:28.290 --> 06:30.880
Is it like this because I hurt it in the dream?

06:32.130 --> 06:33.000
Doesn't really matter.

06:38.960 --> 06:39.670
Devour him.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.960
Not him.

07:01.630 --> 07:05.580
I saw your memories. You were innocent.

07:06.960 --> 07:10.290
Then, you got forced into something worse after death.

07:11.460 --> 07:12.540
So I won't kill you again.

07:13.790 --> 07:15.710
You deserve to pass on.

07:27.250 --> 07:32.080
I was so angry at those kids. I hated them so much.

07:33.830 --> 07:34.710
But...

07:35.330 --> 07:43.080
I must have loved them dearly, before...

07:45.670 --> 07:46.960
Forgive me.

07:51.670 --> 07:52.630
An earthquake?

07:54.420 --> 07:56.540
Yayoi-chan, what's that noise?!

07:56.540 --> 07:57.460
It's okay.

08:01.250 --> 08:03.920
Is he transforming?

08:05.540 --> 08:06.290
No...

08:07.630 --> 08:14.880
One... More... Battle...

08:15.210 --> 08:16.290
He's restored.

08:19.670 --> 08:22.170
Ghosts have a wavering essence, like an aura.

08:23.170 --> 08:27.000
It's a sign of their energy diffusing and exhausting.

08:27.750 --> 08:32.920
The essence of graduate-tier ghosts
doesn't waver, though; it's solid and firm.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.130
Seems this one's an exception.

08:36.000 --> 08:40.500
I can still see his wavering, as if he's not that strong...

08:40.920 --> 08:43.580
...but I can tell he is, just from
the overwhelming power around him.

08:45.880 --> 08:52.080
Just how powerful will he be
when he regains all of his memories?

08:53.380 --> 08:56.830
If he's this strong, and still incomplete...

08:58.130 --> 09:01.170
then I shall call him the Soul in Transition.

08:58.210 --> 09:02.790
<b>SOUL IN TRANSITION</b>

09:03.040 --> 09:09.420
One... More... Battle...

09:09.790 --> 09:12.210
I'll keep bringing you to more battlefields.

09:13.290 --> 09:15.290
If you keep helping me,

09:16.580 --> 09:21.040
I'll help you recover the strength and memories
forged in the heat of countless battles.

09:21.830 --> 09:24.130
They're almost within your grasp now.

09:28.750 --> 09:30.830
Guess that means, "yes."

09:44.630 --> 09:46.210
Found more! Over here!

09:47.880 --> 09:48.630
Hey!

09:49.080 --> 09:50.460
What's the scene inside?

09:50.580 --> 09:54.130
Same as it is outside, the kids and teachers
are all unconscious!

09:54.500 --> 09:56.670
Police and paramedics?

09:56.670 --> 09:58.830
I called them over to help!

10:05.330 --> 10:06.330
Dorothy.

10:08.710 --> 10:09.750
You okay?

10:10.130 --> 10:11.130
What happened?

10:13.880 --> 10:15.210
Hey, wake up!

10:16.250 --> 10:17.750
You okay, kid?

10:22.210 --> 10:24.630
Good. You hurt anywhere?

10:28.670 --> 10:31.580
Hey, it's okay, you're gonna be okay.

10:33.500 --> 10:35.670
Daisuke... He's okay.

10:36.790 --> 10:42.080
And so, the dreaming students
who hadn't been caught were woken, one by one,

10:42.540 --> 10:45.330
and those who were caught
were brought back to their senses.

10:46.170 --> 10:47.040
However...

10:49.500 --> 10:57.170
While they didn't appear to be injured,
seeing a crow would cause them to panic.

10:57.960 --> 11:08.540
The sleeping victims couldn't recall anything,
but felt as if they'd been having a bad dream.

11:09.420 --> 11:18.330
The victims, including Yayoi, Yoko,
and Dorothy, were all rushed to the hospital.

11:18.670 --> 11:24.670
<b>Students, Faculty Fall Unconscious</b>

11:18.670 --> 11:24.670
<b>at Elementary School</b>

11:19.000 --> 11:19.920
Later...

11:20.130 --> 11:24.500
I'm here at Tokikodai Elementary,
where staff and students suddenly fell unconscious.

11:25.170 --> 11:26.790
No injuries were reported, but...

11:26.790 --> 11:32.130
The incident caused enough of a stir
to be featured on national news.

11:33.250 --> 11:43.790
Despite the lack of casualties, 
officials still decided to close the school temporarily.

11:47.170 --> 11:51.790
Didn't plan for that to happen,
but it works out pretty well for me.

11:52.330 --> 11:53.080
Still...

11:53.830 --> 11:54.960
Hozuki-san!

11:56.920 --> 12:00.170
You did such a wonderful job resolving that incident!

12:00.580 --> 12:03.710
Thanks to you, I was able to get just what I wanted!

12:04.880 --> 12:06.080
And what's that?

12:07.500 --> 12:10.960
Did you see that train derailment on TV?

12:12.250 --> 12:16.790
I want to go and see the big black spirit that was there.

12:18.420 --> 12:19.080
Why?

12:19.290 --> 12:24.380
Oh, well, that spirit is a project my allies
have been working on.

12:27.500 --> 12:29.670
A project? What is it?

12:30.130 --> 12:31.920
How to put it...?

12:33.080 --> 12:37.710
It will bring forth a new dawn to the history of life itself.

12:37.710 --> 12:39.710
Dramatic, but true nonetheless.

12:40.540 --> 12:42.920
A new dawn to the history of life?

12:43.580 --> 12:45.630
A project her allies have been working on?

12:47.630 --> 12:48.670
Allies...

12:49.750 --> 12:52.670
When they get replaced, though,
the base color changes.

12:54.130 --> 12:56.540
Good morning, Hozuki-san!

12:58.750 --> 12:59.500
Who're you?

12:59.920 --> 13:06.170
I hadn't forgotten her, but her aura was a different color.

13:07.920 --> 13:11.380
She's not the Dorothy I knew before.

13:12.750 --> 13:14.080
She's been replaced...

13:16.040 --> 13:19.330
...by someone who knows
more about the Spectre of Death.

13:20.250 --> 13:27.540
It's so difficult to take time off school,
so I figured it'd be easier to close the school itself!

13:28.250 --> 13:33.130
To that end, I began a little project
of my own with that teacher's ghost!

13:33.670 --> 13:41.830
But I also wanted to test your capabilities. 
I'm surprised you actually defeated him.

13:42.670 --> 13:43.920
Did I pass the test?

13:44.830 --> 13:46.830
Oh, with flying colors!

13:50.420 --> 13:53.460
Actually, there's a question I wanted to ask you.

13:53.750 --> 13:55.420
My, whatever could it be?

13:58.830 --> 14:00.420
You replaced this girl, didn't you?

14:16.630 --> 14:18.170
You replaced this girl, didn't you?

14:21.880 --> 14:23.250
Just like me.

14:24.880 --> 14:27.130
Oh, you're one of us, then?

14:28.080 --> 14:28.920
Uh-huh.

14:29.580 --> 14:33.790
When a ghost replaces someone,
they're essentially just a regular human.

14:34.210 --> 14:36.710
Attacking her now could get me in legal trouble.

14:37.460 --> 14:41.290
Instead, I'll pretend to be one of them to get in close.

14:43.080 --> 14:50.000
I'll use the info I got from the love hotel ghost
to piece together a lie that sounds true.

14:51.250 --> 14:53.170
How could you tell?

14:53.420 --> 14:55.710
You're way too different from how she used to be.

14:56.210 --> 14:58.460
Were you even trying to hide it?

14:58.880 --> 15:02.460
I was, but I couldn't stand those horrible clothes!

15:03.290 --> 15:06.750
She couldn't tell from the aura alone?
Does she not know, then?

15:07.000 --> 15:11.330
That's what she'll think. She'll assume
I know nothing and let her guard down.

15:12.330 --> 15:16.580
I just did it for the first time last night.
I still don't know how everything works.

15:17.460 --> 15:21.420
I was hoping to meet like-minded spirits.
I was lucky I ran into you.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.710
Oh, my! Yes, you were!

15:23.960 --> 15:29.960
I'd be happy to teach you everything
you need to know, and introduce you to my allies!

15:30.170 --> 15:31.000
Can't wait.

15:31.460 --> 15:36.710
If she's lying, I'll still be able to keep a close eye on her.

15:37.210 --> 15:41.380
She's still only a child.
We could easily corner her if necessary.

15:42.210 --> 15:43.580
I'll join this team of body-stealing spirits.

15:44.670 --> 15:49.170
Then, I'll find out who they're replacing,
what they're like, their true natures,

15:49.290 --> 15:55.330
their numbers, funding, hideout, goals,
and finally, their connection to the Spectre.

15:56.000 --> 16:01.330
I'll peel off every layer of skin, sort through your viscera,
and bare your all for my eyes.

16:02.080 --> 16:08.710
I won't forget... what you did to that teacher's spirits...
and the classmates you hurt, too.

16:09.500 --> 16:11.500
I am going to make you pay.

16:12.290 --> 16:16.290
Oh, yes, where did you come from, Hozuki-san?

16:16.670 --> 16:21.000
I was murdered at a hotel in K City
and wandered for a while after. How about you?

16:21.790 --> 16:23.210
Oh, me?

16:25.290 --> 16:27.630
I used to possess this doll here.

16:28.210 --> 16:34.750
After replacing this girl, I put her soul in that doll
in my stead so I can take care of her.

16:35.290 --> 16:40.710
I remind her she's trapped in there,
and can never go back to the way she was.

16:40.710 --> 16:43.080
It's become our little daily ritual.

16:44.130 --> 16:44.880
See?

16:45.080 --> 16:47.130
If I want her to like me, I should say...

16:48.210 --> 16:49.630
That's what I did, too.

16:49.880 --> 16:50.670
Wow!

16:51.130 --> 16:52.130
She's disgusting.

16:53.420 --> 16:55.330
Yayoi-chan!

16:56.000 --> 16:57.080
My ride's here.

16:58.000 --> 17:00.040
Gotta go. See you later.

17:00.380 --> 17:01.290
Of course!

17:03.790 --> 17:06.460
I forgot to ask her about the arm.

17:10.170 --> 17:14.540
I hope my mom comes soon...
Especially since Yayoi went off somewhere.

17:14.540 --> 17:18.790
Yayoi-chan? Yayoi-chan!

17:19.710 --> 17:25.130
Still can't believe everyone at her school
passed out like that... I'm glad she's okay.

17:25.790 --> 17:28.830
Oh, God, this wasn't because of her, was it?

17:28.960 --> 17:33.290
Ugh, why do Mom and Dad
have to be out of the country right now?!

17:33.290 --> 17:36.080
I don't know what paperwork I need to fill out!

17:36.080 --> 17:37.290
E-excuse me!

17:38.080 --> 17:39.960
Are you Yayoi-chan's mom?

17:40.250 --> 17:41.290
MOM?!

17:42.330 --> 17:43.790
I-I'm her cousin.

17:43.790 --> 17:48.130
Wow, really?! You're so pretty and tall!

17:49.000 --> 17:54.460
I've been looking for Yayoi-chan
but I can't seen to find her.

17:56.040 --> 17:59.710
I wanted to thank her in person,
since we're gonna be off school for a while...

18:00.630 --> 18:02.830
Could you tell her for me?

18:03.330 --> 18:06.290
Did she help you during what happened at school?

18:06.290 --> 18:07.330
Y-yes!

18:07.420 --> 18:11.500
You probably won't believe me, but...

18:11.790 --> 18:19.040
I had a nightmare that I had to play hide-and-seek,
and this really scary monster was chasing me...

18:19.580 --> 18:23.170
But Yayoi-chan came to rescue me.

18:24.710 --> 18:29.130
I saw things that shouldn't exist.
Strange, horrible things...

18:29.880 --> 18:32.330
It really freaked me out.

18:34.130 --> 18:37.830
But then she was having me follow her, and...

18:38.420 --> 18:46.290
When I woke up, I was still shaking,
and scared, and my heart was pounding...

18:47.080 --> 18:49.540
But somehow... I just...

18:50.330 --> 18:54.080
I don't know. It felt like our adventure was over.

18:54.920 --> 18:58.130
Oh, geez. What am I even saying?

18:58.710 --> 19:01.670
I'm sorry. I probably sound like some kind of weirdo.

19:02.750 --> 19:04.920
Oh, she's like me.

19:05.960 --> 19:11.460
I discovered it when I met Kei-kun...
Now she's going through it with Yayoi-chan.

19:12.750 --> 19:19.210
You're right. Your mom and dad
might freak out if you told them all that.

19:20.790 --> 19:24.460
But I get it. I know how you feel.

19:24.960 --> 19:33.380
Amidst all that fear, you got a glimpse into a world
you couldn't have known on your own.

19:34.540 --> 19:38.040
Feels like you've peered through
a mysterious, forbidden door, right?

19:39.710 --> 19:42.880
I've had that exact same experience before.

19:45.540 --> 19:51.460
Even if no one else understands, I promise that I will.

19:52.210 --> 19:57.790
You can be honest with me.
You can always tell me exactly how you feel.

19:58.880 --> 20:00.790
Don't let the word "normal" tie you down.

20:01.710 --> 20:03.670
You can call me whenever you want,

20:05.080 --> 20:07.170
Because you're just like me.

20:10.330 --> 20:15.210
We're both obsessed
with unfathomable fear. Isn't that right?

20:23.460 --> 20:24.460
Yeah!

20:29.750 --> 20:31.920
Thanks for the ride, Eiko.

20:32.210 --> 20:33.420
Of course!

20:33.710 --> 20:35.460
I was so worried about you.

20:35.630 --> 20:36.290
Sorry.

20:37.460 --> 20:39.580
Is it cool if I put a call on speaker?

20:40.250 --> 20:41.880
Sure. Who're you calling?

20:42.580 --> 20:43.290
You'll see.

20:46.460 --> 20:47.170
Hello?

20:47.540 --> 20:49.000
Hey, Granny.

20:50.420 --> 20:53.580
Yayoi? Ready to start taking lessons?

20:53.830 --> 20:54.460
No.

20:54.460 --> 20:55.420
Shami-san?!

20:57.000 --> 20:58.630
Then what do you want?

20:59.130 --> 21:03.330
I'll cut to the chase: I met someone who'd been replaced.

21:05.710 --> 21:06.960
Go on, then.

21:07.540 --> 21:13.830
A girl at my school with the sight was replaced
by a spirit, who made contact with me.

21:14.630 --> 21:19.750
So, I pretended to also be a body-snatcher
to get information out of her.

21:20.460 --> 21:25.500
Do you have any idea the kind of danger
you're puttin' yourself in?

21:26.170 --> 21:27.750
That's why I'm calling.

21:28.500 --> 21:33.210
She said she has "allies."
She spilled loads of info about them, too.

21:33.580 --> 21:39.920
No clue what type of spirit she is,
but her body's young brain must limit her intelligence.

21:40.500 --> 21:47.250
But some of her allies must be smarter,
or have high social status and authority.

21:48.000 --> 21:56.250
Since they approached me, they must know
my address, my family, and my friends.

21:58.750 --> 22:00.130
I'll be in Kyoto for a while.

22:00.830 --> 22:06.920
I set up hidden cameras around my house
and other spots, and there's a transmitter in the arm,

22:07.130 --> 22:11.210
so if someone steals it, we'll know
who they are and where they're hiding.

22:12.040 --> 22:15.380
I'll use that information to identify
the individuals we're looking for.

22:16.210 --> 22:18.580
I know a friend who's got a knack for it.

22:20.130 --> 22:24.880
I'll narrow down the list of members
and their locations, then share that info with you.

22:26.210 --> 22:31.960
I want you to organize a group of spiritualists you trust
to hunt those members down.

22:37.630 --> 22:40.960
You're one hell of a brat, you know that?!

22:41.210 --> 22:45.080
You're off in Kyoto, yeah?
I'll keep an eye on people for you.

22:45.500 --> 22:49.080
Lemme know where they are
and I'll send the youngin's after them.

22:50.130 --> 22:52.750
One of 'em might've killed my sister.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.330
Leave it all to me.

22:56.830 --> 22:58.420
This means war!

23:00.040 --> 23:00.710
Mm-hmm.

23:13.540 --> 23:14.290
Ai-chan...

23:21.710 --> 23:29.880
Though the Spectre of Death looms over her,
Yayoi sets her sights on taking down Ai's god.

23:30.790 --> 23:39.750
As Keitaro and Eiko prepare for their trip to Kyoto,
dark figures begin to move in the shadows.
